"summary": "The file defines the multicolour triangle Ramsey number R_k(3) through Mathlib's `TopEdgeLabeling`, `labelGraph` and `CliqueFree 3`; this matches the paper. Three targets are faithful: R_k(3)^{1/k} → ∞, the explicit lower bound with a specific constant, and log R_k = Θ(k log k). The main caveat is `triangleRamseyNumber_log_sharp_coefficients`. It is stated with `∃ ε, 0 < ε → ...` instead of `∀ ε > 0`, so any ε ≤ 0 makes it vacuously true, and it says nothing about the (1/3 - o(1)) k log k ≤ log R_k ≤ (1+o(1)) k log k claim.",
